(text "Cold start only: write output latch=0 BEFORE direction=0xFFE0.\nPico boot/reconnect reads actual state; never initializes U903.\nCompleted commands leave RUN_SET=0 and CLEAR_REQUEST=0.\nSTOP / hardware faults clear U503 even with Pico absent." (at 20 263 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "22f7953f-2371-4b89-97cf-845f7a424487"))
(text "NTC ratio uses AIN0 / AIN1 at +/-4.096 V PGA.\nBoard temperature is a local proxy; calibrate 100k divider loading.\n75 C protection is independent U1001, not ADC firmware." (at 195 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06a3c375-9bd4-432c-aeb0-de1de080e577"))
